reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wealthy son of a distinguished family, Ryuuichi is a high achiever with excellent grades. He's a pefectionist, and hates to be second-best or leave things incomplete. Ryuuichi leads the school council as its president with great responsibility and wisdom. He likes comic haiku, and is sure to read at least one after school. He is the Blue Hotokenser."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10334"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/5811cf2c63f37653f4578329cf70f0f7bf35bd265c5332dff5055f9b1c7226e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c04b359d880048e9b3349524c77474b88cf117cfb7894b241b54ee1ce2ffb893.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"赤羽根 健治","creatorId":"vndb:s1381","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1381","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1381","name":"赤羽根 健治","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32223","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10335","characterName":"皇 陸斗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10335"},"originalCharacterName":"皇 陸斗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1211"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The ace of the school's swimming club with a hearty and lively personality. Rikuto has a poor sense of taste and grades that put him at risk of dropping out. Despite being childhood friends with Ryuuichi, they get along as well as cats and dogs, and are frequently at odds with one another. He's popular with women, but he does not realise so. His curry apparently has a very bad taste. He is the Yellow Hotokenser."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10335"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb983eb6954bab706cd92816ca42e745870c1ce2acb93c187d0081b62988841b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1af6d4cd544604b8d6c50fa3d286d78a1698c83623e5468986ba4735aba29951.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"髙木 俊","creatorId":"vndb:s1387","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1387","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1387","name":"髙木 俊","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32225","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10336","characterName":"堂島 翠月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10336"},"originalCharacterName":"堂島 翠月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"516"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bright, cheerful and somewhat affectionate, Mitsuki throws everyone off with his comments and actions that are hard to gauge the seriousness of. Even though he is friendly and sociable, Mitsuki has an unexpected side of liking to be alone on the school roof and just stare at the sky... He likes sweet things and giving people strange nicnames (he himself doesn't seem to realise they're strange). He is the Green Hotokenser."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10336"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e75b7ca050196a264678684092c0f206005722534a452c1c93311554dfcbe32.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/775e8b57c3a795b4bb1cf88d1ebd0f676c967743fd783a55398201a1d7967826.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32221","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10337","characterName":"黒崎 依琉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10337"},"originalCharacterName":"黒崎 依琉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1231"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kureha's classmate, Eru doesn't let people come close to him and is always aggressively hostile. Calling himself \"Karura\", he assists the Hotokensers' enemy, the Akuno Tezaaki. His true objectives are shrouded in mystery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10337"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3aeacd7eb62a6df25633eec0fa80e47541e8e8fc2f16ce63a34c3e70488a1f28.web